# Phase international grade (Terrana ERP)

At the **end of every phase**, grade Terrana against tier-1 references before starting the next phase.

## Benchmarks

| Area | References |
|------|------------|
| ERP master data | Odoo, SAP Business One, NetSuite |
| Speed / UX | Banking apps, Stripe Dashboard |
| Security | OWASP + Supabase RLS |

## Grade scale

| Score | Meaning |
|-------|---------|
| **Beat** | Better or faster than reference at this scale |
| **Match** | On par — OK to ship |
| **Below** | Gap — fix before next phase |

**Rule:** No phase ships with any **Below** score.

## Report after each phase

Include in SETUP.md or commit notes:

1. Grade table (UX, data model, speed, security, future-proofing)
2. Manual test checklist (all items checked)
3. Build + lint pass
4. Known deferred items (explicit phase number)
